+|{set:cellbgcolor:#FFFFFF}
+`mfr_en`                        |31:31  |R      |IMP        |Indicate if the IOPMP implements Multi Faults Record, that is `ERR_MFR` and `ERR_INFO.svc`.
+|===
+
+[cols="<2,<1,<1,<1,<6"]
+|===
